KONOHAGAKURE — ANBU (ANSATSU SENTOU TOKUSHU BUTAI) DIVISION ROSTER
CLASSIFICATION: Restricted. Codenames only. Reports directly to the Hokage.

Codename    | Mask Motif | Squad Role          | Notes
------------|------------|---------------------|--------------------------------
Inu (Dog)   | Hound      | Assault / capture   | (former designation, ret. to active jonin)
Neko (Cat)  | Feline     | Squad lead          | Guard division
Tori (Bird) | Avian      | Recon / tracking    | —
Tenzo/Yamato| —          | Capture / Wood user | Special assignment under the Hokage
Uzuki, Yugao| Cat        | Kenjutsu            | Hokage guard platoon

ANBU operate under codename and mask; true identities are sealed. Membership, missions, and casualties are classified. The Root sub-division is documented separately under restricted access.
Maintained under direct Hokage authority.
